                                                "text": "[A]ye, a stove boat will make me an immortal by brevet."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b65e469f-527b-4487-b7b5-80e5d8e8e273",
                                                "sense_id": "c49e1230-aeec-32af-a3c2-fdb7576ddf90",
                                                "text": "\"A dead whale or a stove boat!\""
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "931701ea-685e-4957-97f8-85cb70f6f50c",
                                                "sense_id": "c49e1230-aeec-32af-a3c2-fdb7576ddf90",
                                                "text": "\"Our cracked four-pounders made an awful din / but with one fat ball, the Yank stove us in.\""
                                            }
